Package: tgskk
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fcitx5 (>= 5.1.7), python3 (>= 3.12), skkdic
Description: SKK input method for fcitx5 with local context ranking
 Uses CSKK dictionaries for immediate conversion, optional local AI ranking,
 and a bundled Google SKK server for readings without local candidates.
 Includes the CPU inference worker; model weights are installed separately
 with tgskk-setup-model.
